{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "4d1b13f9-6401-478d-b3f5-53394f04faea",
    "name": "Ouroboros - Auth",
    "description": "Endpoints do auth-service.\n\nFluxo sugerido: Register User -> Confirm Email -> Login -> Get User By Id / Search User -> Refresh Access Token -> Logout.\n\nOs tokens de confirmacao de e-mail e de login sao guardados automaticamente nas variaveis da collection. O token de redefinicao de senha nao volta na resposta (so aparece no log do servico, no Seq) — copie ele para a variavel `passwordResetToken` antes de rodar Reset Password.\n\nGet User By Id e Search User exigem Bearer token (`accessToken`, preenchido pelo Login). Perfil `User` so consulta a si mesmo; `Admin` consulta qualquer usuario.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "User",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register User",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"emailConfirmationToken\", body.emailConfirmationToken);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"userId\", body.id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"login\": \"{{login}}\",\n  \"fullName\": \"Usuario de Teste\",\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "users"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Cadastra um usuario e devolve o token de confirmacao de e-mail (temporario, so em dev). Todo cadastro nasce com perfil `User` (campo `role` da resposta); o body nao aceita perfil.\n\n- `201` usuario criado (header `Location`)\n- `400` dados invalidos, login/e-mail ja usados ou senha fora da politica"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Confirm Email",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"{{emailConfirmationToken}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users/confirm-email",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "users",
                "confirm-email"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Confirma o e-mail do usuario com o token gerado no cadastro.\n\n- `200` e-mail confirmado\n- `400` token invalido, expirado ou ja usado"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Request Password Reset",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"loginOrEmail\": \"{{email}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users/password-reset/request",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "users",
                "password-reset",
                "request"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Solicita a redefinicao de senha. A resposta e a mesma exista ou nao a conta; o token so aparece no log do servico (Seq).\n\n- `202` solicitacao aceita\n- `400` login/e-mail nao informado\n- `429` limite de 5 solicitacoes por IP a cada 15 minutos"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Reset Password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"{{passwordResetToken}}\",\n  \"newPassword\": \"{{newPassword}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users/password-reset/confirm",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "users",
                "password-reset",
                "confirm"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Redefine a senha com o token recebido. Preencha a variavel `passwordResetToken` com o token do log antes de rodar.\n\n- `204` senha redefinida\n- `400` token invalido/expirado/ja usado ou senha fora da politica\n- `429` limite de 10 tentativas por IP a cada 15 minutos"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get User By Id",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{accessToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "users",
                "{{userId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Consulta um usuario pelo externalId (preenchido pelo Register User). Devolve so dados nao sensiveis: externalId, login, fullName, email, role, active e createdAt.\n\n- `200` usuario encontrado\n- `401` sem token, token invalido ou expirado\n- `403` perfil `User` consultando outro usuario\n- `404` usuario nao encontrado"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Search User",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{accessToken}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"login\": \"{{login}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users/search",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "users",
                "search"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Consulta um usuario por login ou e-mail, informados no body (nunca na URL). O body deve ter exatamente um dos dois campos (`login` ou `email`).\n\n- `200` usuario encontrado\n- `400` nenhum ou ambos os campos informados\n- `401` sem token, token invalido ou expirado\n- `403` perfil `User` consultando outro usuario\n- `404` usuario nao encontrado"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"accessToken\", body.accessToken);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"refreshToken\", body.refreshToken);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"login\": \"{{login}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Autentica o usuario e devolve access token + refresh token. O access token carrega o perfil do usuario no claim `role`.\n\n- `200` autenticado\n- `400` usuario inativo (e-mail ainda nao confirmado)\n- `401` credenciais invalidas"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh Access Token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"accessToken\", body.accessToken);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"refreshToken\", body.refreshToken);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "refresh"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Gera um novo par de tokens com rotacao: o refresh token usado e revogado.\n\n- `200` novos tokens\n- `400` refresh token nao informado\n- `401` refresh token invalido, expirado ou revogado"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "logout"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Revoga o refresh token. Idempotente: token ja revogado ou expirado tambem devolve 204.\n\n- `204` logout feito\n- `401` refresh token nao informado ou invalido"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8082"
    },
    {
      "key": "login",
      "value": "usuario.teste"
    },
    {
      "key": "email",
      "value": "usuario.teste@example.com"
    },
    {
      "key": "password",
      "value": "Senha@123"
    },
    {
      "key": "newPassword",
      "value": "NovaSenha@456"
    },
    {
      "key": "userId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "emailConfirmationToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "passwordResetToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "accessToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "refreshToken",
      "value": ""
    }
  ]
}
